#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "thumbnail"
msgstr "sličica"

#. Tag: author
#: index.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Carsten.Pfeiffer; &Carsten.Pfeiffer.mail;"
msgstr "&Carsten.Pfeiffer; &Carsten.Pfeiffer.mail;"

#. Tag: trans_comment
#: index.docbook:13
#, no-c-format
msgid "ROLES_OF_TRANSLATORS"
msgstr "ULOGE_PREVODIOCA"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The thumbnail kioslave is used by &kde; for network transparent and "
"persistent generation of thumbnails."
msgstr ""
"Sličica kioslave se koristi od strane &kde; za transparentnost mreže i "
"postojanu proizvodnju sličica."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The thumbnail kioslave uses plugins to generate the actual thumbnails. You "
"can enable viewing of these thumbnails from the <menuchoice><guimenu>View</"
"guimenu> <guisubmenu>Preview</guisubmenu></menuchoice> submenu, available in "
"&konqueror; in file manager mode."
msgstr ""
"Sličica kioslave koristi dodatke pri generisanju aktualnih sličica. Možete "
"omogućiti gledanje tih sličica sa <menuchoice><guimenu>Pregled</guimenu> "
"<guisubmenu>Prikaz</guisubmenu></menuchoice> podizbornika, dostupno u "
"&konqueror; u načinu rada upravljanja datotekama."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The thumbnail kioslave is not directly useful to a user, but if you are a "
"developer, you can use it within your own applications to create file "
"previews."
msgstr ""
"Sličica kioslave nije izravno korisna za korisnika, ali ako ste programer, "
"možete je koristiti u svojim vlastitim aplikacijama pri kreiranju pregleda "
"datoteka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"See the documentation in the sources for more information. You will find "
"these at <filename>$<envar>KDEDIR</envar>/include/kio/thumbcreator.h</"
"filename> or in the source folder <filename class=\"directory\">kdebase/"
"runtime/kioslave/thumbnail</filename>"
msgstr ""
"Pogledajte dokumentaciju u izvorima za više informacija. Naći ćete ih u "
"<filename>$<envar>KDEDIR</envar>/include/kio/thumbcreator.h</filename> ili u "
"izvornom folderu <filename class=\"directory\">kdebase/runtime/kioslave/"
"thumbnail</filename>"
